  },
  {
    "id": "nc-109-1-2-8-choice-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$m$ 為225的平方根之一，且 $m>0$，則 $m=$？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$\\sqrt{15}$",
          "15",
          "$15^2$",
          "$225^2$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "d17dd7ab0b4d4604484ae126133ece13989321d769edcccbf884a097dd3f7e31"
  },
  {
    "id": "nc-109-1-2-8-choice-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt3}$、$\\frac{\\sqrt{24}}2$、$\\frac23\\sqrt6$、$\\sqrt{25}$，上列根式中哪一個是最簡根式？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$\\frac{\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt3}$",
          "$\\frac{\\sqrt{24}}2$",
          "$\\frac23\\sqrt6$",
          "$\\sqrt{25}$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "d17dd7ab0b4d4604484ae126133ece13989321d769edcccbf884a097dd3f7e31"
  },
  {
    "id": "nc-109-1-2-8-choice-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "將 $\\frac4{3\\sqrt5}$ 化成最簡根式的結果為何？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$\\frac{4\\sqrt5}3$",
          "$\\frac4{15}$",
          "$\\frac{4\\sqrt{15}}3$",
          "$\\frac4{15}\\sqrt5$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "d17dd7ab0b4d4604484ae126133ece13989321d769edcccbf884a097dd3f7e31"
  },
  {
    "id": "nc-109-1-2-8-choice-5",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列何者的值與其他三者不是同類方根？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$-\\sqrt{24}$",
          "$2\\sqrt3$",
          "$-\\sqrt{12}$",
          "$-\\sqrt2\\times\\sqrt6$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "d17dd7ab0b4d4604484ae126133ece13989321d769edcccbf884a097dd3f7e31"
  },
  {
    "id": "nc-109-1-2-8-choice-6",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列敘述何者正確？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$0.3^2$ 是0.9",
          "4是 $-16$ 的平方根",
          "$a=(-5)^2$，所以 $-5$ 是 $a$ 的平方根",
          "7的平方根只有一個"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "d17dd7ab0b4d4604484ae126133ece13989321d769edcccbf884a097dd3f7e31"
  },
  {
    "id": "nc-109-1-2-8-choice-7",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，$\\triangle ABC$ 為直角三角形，且 $\\overline{AB}=a$、$\\overline{CA}=b$、$\\overline{BC}=c$，若分別以 $\\overline{AB}$、$\\overline{BC}$、$\\overline{CA}$ 為邊長向外畫出正方形甲、乙、丙，則下列何者正確？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$a^2+c^2=b^2$",
          "$a+c=b$",
          "$a+b=c$",
          "$a^2+b^2=c^2$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "d17dd7ab0b4d4604484ae126133ece13989321d769edcccbf884a097dd3f7e31",
